WEBVTT

01:04:29.417 --> 01:04:31.143
And so the thing that gives me hope

01:04:31.167 --> 01:04:33.559
is that the lies have to be obvious now.

01:04:33.583 --> 01:04:35.268
The lies have to be,

01:04:35.292 --> 01:04:37.059
that was a reasonable use of force.

01:04:37.083 --> 01:04:39.559
The lie has to be, 
we don't have the money.

01:04:39.583 --> 01:04:43.559
The lie has to be, that's too hard,
it's too big of a challenge.

01:04:43.583 --> 01:04:47.393
This stuff feels impossible
every day except today,

01:04:47.417 --> 01:04:50.434
because the alternative is
we lose everything.

01:04:50.458 --> 01:04:51.726
Everything is at stake,

01:04:51.750 --> 01:04:53.726
our democracy is at stake,

01:04:53.750 --> 01:04:56.351
the people we choose to be,
we claim to be,

01:04:56.375 --> 01:04:57.934
that's at stake.

01:04:57.958 --> 01:04:59.684
And in the face of that,

01:04:59.708 --> 01:05:02.184
I think we can do impossible things.